{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在上半屏靠左的大号文字，尤其是金黄色高亮的“憋着一股气”和“当作自己人”；随后容易被下方更大、更醒目的白色长句吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"隐约知道他心里还憋着气，想起过去曾被人当作自己人。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、生气，夹杂短暂的高兴；酸涩和失落不一定能第一眼抓到。\",\n  \"missed\": \"短暂高兴为什么转为酸涩，以及他意识到过去的日子回不去了，却不确定离开后是否真的会更好。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号文字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块，需要拼接才能理解情绪从短暂高兴转为酸涩的原因。\",\n    \"上方长句包含憋气、回忆、被接纳、短暂高兴等多层意思。\",\n    \"下方长句又包含过去无法重来和对离开后生活的疑问，完整理解需要读句子。\",\n    \"金黄色放大的关键词能提示情绪和关系，但单独不足以交代完整处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "85a9c6b7-89bb-48eb-a01b-80ac2279c6e7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012322064466Z", "elapsed_seconds": 29.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:23:51.513592+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2c0a76fff84e5f5f7ec418b44d53b07e925753c86cfd59edadd505f4656a1848", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3e